+    README.md
+
+backend/tests/unit/core/config/
+    test_settings.py
+    test_exceptions.py
+
+Requirements
+
+1. environment.py
+- Create an Environment enum.
+- Values:
+  - development
+  - testing
+  - staging
+  - production
+
+2. exceptions.py
+- Create ConfigurationError(Exception).
+
+3. settings.py
+- Use BaseSettings from pydantic_settings.
+- Use SettingsConfigDict.
+- Load .env automatically.
+- env_prefix = "AI_PLATFORM_"
+
+Settings should include:
+
+Application
+- app_name
+- app_version
+- environment
+- debug
+
+Server
+- host
+- port
+
+Database
+- database_url
+
+Redis
+- redis_url
+
+Security
+- secret_key
+
+Use Pydantic v2 syntax only.
+Do not use deprecated env=Field syntax.
+Do not create validators unless absolutely required.
+
+4. __init__.py
+
+Export only:
+
+- Settings
+- Environment
+- ConfigurationError
+
+5. README.md
+
+Document:
+- Purpose
+- Responsibilities
+- Public API
+- Usage
+- Future roadmap
+
+Tests
+
+- Settings initialization
+- Environment enum
+- ConfigurationError
+
+Constraints
+
+- Python 3.12
+- Google-style docstrings
+- Full type hints
+- Ruff clean
+- MyPy clean
+- Pytest passing
+- No loader.py
+- No interfaces.py
+- No validators.py
+- No types.py
+- No unnecessary abstractions
+- Do not commit.

